.. _`variable filter`:

VARIABLE FILTER
===============

The variable filter is last in the chain because it's the last thing
we want to expand on.

Variables are expanded like this:

::

   > #var a1 jerk
   > say hi to the $a1.

will expand to "say hi to the jerk." which will be sent to the mud.
